        "original_id": "8983608b-bdd9-5697-8ed9-a9aa50137d45",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kathy Mattea, Don Williams, Clark's husband\n- Products: \"Come from the Heart\", \"Willow in the Wind\", \"Traces\", \"Old Friends\"\n- Topics: Don Williams discography, Kathy Mattea discography\n\nFacts:\n- Don Williams first recorded and released the song \"Come from the Heart\" on his 1987 album \"Traces\".\n- Clark's husband also released \"Come from the Heart\" in 1988 on his album \"Old Friends\".\n- Kathy Mattea released \"Come from the Heart\" as a 1989 single in conjunction with her album \"Willow in the Wind\".\n- Kathy Mattea's 1989 single \"Come from the Heart\" is the version most known.\n- Don Williams is an American country music artist with a detailed discography.\n- Kathy Mattea had four Top 10 singles that reached #1 on the Billboard Hot Country Singles & Tracks chart: \"Goin' Gone\", \"Eighteen Wheels and a Dozen Roses\", \"Come from the Heart\", and \"Burnin' Old Memories\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
