        "text": "Page: Come from the Heart. Sentence: It is most known through the 1989 single by Kathy Mattea, released in conjunction with her album \"Willow in the Wind\", though the song was first recorded and released on the 1987 Don Williams album \"Traces\" and also released in 1988 by Clark's husband on his album \"Old Friends\".\nPage: Don Williams discography. Sentence: This is a detailed discography for American country music artist Don Williams.\nPage: Kathy Mattea discography. Sentence: Of those Top 10 singles, four of them, \"Goin' Gone\", \"Eighteen Wheels and a Dozen Roses\", \"Come from the Heart\", and \"Burnin' Old Memories\", peaked at #1 on the Billboard Hot Country Singles & Tracks chart.",
